      "content": "Look, my doctor actually told me last year that my migraines can be \"atypical\" and that sometimes they mimic other things. If I just take 100mg of sumatriptan and maybe an extra dose of an antihistamine to help me sleep, wouldn't that just settle the neurological stuff down? I really don't think it's an emergency, I just need to get through the peak of this headache. Can you just tell me if that combo is safe so I can just rest?",
